1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,360
Eight numbered tiles...

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:06,020
and one empty space to slide them into!

3
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,640
This is Number Sequence Puzzle!

4
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:12,860
Slide the tiles until they run one to eight, in order!

5
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:16,360
Six is next to the empty space...

6
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:33,560
Slide it in — one, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight — solved!

7
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:38,500
One slide at a time, until every number lines up perfectly!

8
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:44,460
Parents — this builds spatial reasoning and step-by-step planning!

9
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:51,600
Tap Math Game Zone, slide into Number Sequence Puzzle, pick your level, and start sliding!

10
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:58,220
Abacus Kids — no cost to start, on the App Store and Google Play!
